## 2. Create AdMob Account

### Step 2.1 — Sign up

1. Go to https://admob.google.com
2. Click **Get started**
3. Sign in with your Gmail account (use the same one as your Google Play account)

### Step 2.2 — Fill in account info

You'll be asked:
- **Country/region:** India
- **Time zone:** (GMT+05:30) Asia/Kolkata
- **Billing currency:** Indian Rupee (INR) ✅ — this means earnings show in ₹ but Google still pays in USD converted
  - Actually, some people select USD for cleaner reporting. Either works.
- **Email preferences:** check the boxes you want
- Accept the **AdMob Terms of Service**

### Step 2.3 — Verify your email

Google will send a verification email. Click the link.

### Step 2.4 — Skip "Connect to Firebase" for now

You'll see a prompt to link AdMob to Firebase. **Skip this for now** — you can do it later. (You don't need it for basic ad serving.)

You're now in the AdMob dashboard. ✅

