## 11. Where to Place Ads in TRUE CONCEPT — FINAL PLAN

Here's the exact ad placement plan for your app. **Only these 4 ad slots — nothing more.**

| # | Ad Type | Where | When |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Banner** | Bottom of student screens | Always visible while student is logged in |
| 2 | **Interstitial** | After MCQ set submission | Every time (60-sec throttle) |
| 3 | **Interstitial** | After finishing an experiment | Every time (60-sec throttle) |
| 4 | **Rewarded** | Full-screen gate after 3 hours of usage | Watch ad to unlock 3 more hours |

### Where ads MUST NOT appear

| Screen | Why no ads |
|---|---|
| Login / OTP screen | Looks unprofessional, hurts conversion |
| Note reading (full-screen view) | Kills focus during studying |
| Admin panel | Admins are you, not target audience |
| Inside running simulations | Breaks the experience |

### Visual hierarchy (student screens)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│ Header (sticky)                 │ ← never covered
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│                                 │
│   Main content scrolls          │
│                                 │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│ Bottom pill nav (floating)      │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│ AdMob Banner (50px)             │ ← Ad #1 (always visible)
└─────────────────────────────────┘

After completing MCQ or Experiment:
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│                                 │
│      [Full-screen Ad #2/3]      │ ← Interstitial
│                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────┘

After 3 hours of usage:
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│  ╔═══════════════════════════╗  │
│  ║ 🔒 Time's Up!             ║  │
│  ║ Watch Ad → 3 More Hours   ║  │ ← Ad #4 gate modal
│  ╚═══════════════════════════╝  │
└─────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Why this plan is balanced

- ✅ **Banner is non-intrusive** — students forget it's there after a few minutes
- ✅ **Interstitials only appear at natural breaks** (after finishing something)
- ✅ **The 60-sec throttle** prevents back-to-back ads if students rush through MCQs
- ✅ **5-second timeout** in `showInterstitial()` skips any slow-loading ads — no annoying waits
- ✅ **The rewarded gate is the only "forced" ad** — but students get 3 hours free first, and the value (continue learning) is clear

